sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant F as founder
  participant V as voice 进程
  participant T as Discord thread
  participant M as mailbox
  participant L as Lead 脑子
  participant B as Bridge 回程
  F->>V: 说一句话
  V->>V: 转写 → 脱敏 → 写本机账 captured
  V->>T: 发 🗣️ 镜像消息(带 nonce 防重复)
  T-->>V: 返回 Discord 消息 id
  V->>M: chat-ingest(origin=voice, 作者=founder, id=镜像 id)
  M->>L: 泵成批投递(和文字同路)
  L->>T: 在 thread 回帖(和平时一样)
  B->>T: 轮询绑定频道,只认这个 Lead 的 bot
  B->>B: 记账 voice_outbound(queued)
  V->>B: 认领这一条(拿 attempt token)
  V->>F: 用 Lead 的音色念出来
  V->>B: 回执 confirmed / unconfirmed
